--- a/wpeimg/checksum.py
+++ b/wpeimg/checksum.py
@@ -2,36 +2,119 @@
 
 The value is exposed through a one-shot helper and through an incremental
 accumulator, so a caller that already walks the file once can reuse the pass.
+
+The algorithm matches Windows ``imagehlp!MapFileAndCheckSumW``: a ones-complement
+running sum of every 16-bit little-endian word in the file (skipping the four
+bytes of the CheckSum field itself), with the file length added at the end.
 """
 
 import struct
-import zlib
 
 
